- The integer array parameter `nums` must not be null.
- The integer array parameter `nums` length is equal to the integer parameter `n`.
- All values in the integer array parameter `nums` are greater than or equal to -100 and are less than or equal to 100.
- The integer result is the maximum value of the rotation function `F(0), F(1), ..., F(n-1)`.
- The integer result is less than or equal to the maximum value of a 32-bit integer.